===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The sound of a sudden heavy fall.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1863|author=Sheridan Le Fanu|title={{w|The House by the Churchyard}}|passage=As she beheld her, poor Mrs. Mack's heart fluttered up to her mouth, and then dropped with a dreadful '''plump''', into the pit of her stomach.}}

